  "details": "I configured the cache directory in config.json as follows:\n\n{\n\n  \"cache_directory\": \"/custom/path\"\n\n}\n\nIssue:\n\nHowever, when downloading files, they are still temporarily generated in the following local directory for a split second:\n\nC:\\Users\\(UserName)\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Unity\\Temp\n\nImpact:\n\nBecause of this behavior, the application moves the files between the local drive and the specified cache drive. This intermediate file transfer causes unnecessary disk I/O operations and significantly degrades performance/response times.\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nDownloaded files should be streamed or generated directly in the configured cache_directory to avoid any slow local drive transfers.",
